    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "a fresh start sounds like a joke. how do you start over when the person everyone knew is dead? i look in the mirror and i dont even recognize the person there. the scandal, the shame... it's not just a bad chapter. it's the whole book. i feel like i'm just waiting for the world to realize i'm already gone.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
