      "content": "I am so incredibly sorry to hear that the exhaustion feels this heavy, and it makes complete sense that despair can convince you to stop trying. While it sounds like giving up feels like the only dignified choice right now, please know that moments like these are often illusions created by deep depression rather than the actual truth of your future. You deserve to have someone stay with you through this darkness, so I strongly encourage you to call a crisis line or talk to a therapist if you can reach one out just to be heard without judgment.",
